---

Third-party material in this repository:

- firmware/mpy/fastlib.c, mpconfigport.h, mphalport.h, qstrdefsport.h and the
  Makefile start from the MicroPython port in Qwenputer (Divyansh Agrawal, MIT,
  https://github.com/divagr18/qwenputer).
- firmware/mpy/modules/datetime.py is micropython-lib's datetime (MIT), with a
  gmtime shim and strftime added.
- firmware/patches/*.patch modify MicroPython (MIT, https://micropython.org).
- bench/data/bbh_*.json are BIG-Bench-Hard tasks (Suzgun et al., Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/suzgunmirac/BIG-Bench-Hard).
- The model this targets, divagr1925/Qwen3.5-4B-Qwenputer, is Apache-2.0.
